\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"This city is also given great importance in traditional legends. It is recorded that Lord Shri Mahavir travelled through here. In the first century, Acharya Shri Vajra Swami came here for darshan. Minister Shri Uhad and Prince Sundar went from here and founded the city of Osian. This is also the birthplace of the poet Shri Magh, author of the epic \\\\\\\"Shishupal Vadh.\\\\\\\" In Samvat 992, Siddhashir Gani composed \\\\\\\"Upamiti Bhava Prapancha Katha\\\\\\\" here. The ancestors of minister Vimalasha lived here. The Shrimali lineage originated here.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"This city has witnessed many periods of rise and fall. A wealthy merchant built a beautiful and grand temple and installed a five-metal image of Lord Parshwanath in it. Out of fear of Muslim invasion, this image was hidden away. In Vikram Samvat 1651, when excavation was carried out at the temple site, this image was found by the people, together with a samavasarana and several other images. This image of Parshwanath was then installed with great pomp and ceremony in the temple of Lord Shantinath.\\\"}],\\\"$L24\\\",\\\"$L25\\\",\\\"$L26\\\",\\\"$L27\\\",\\\"$L28\\\",\\\"$L29\\\",\\\"$L2a\\\",\\\"$L2b\\\",\\\"$L2c\\\",\\\"$L2d\\\",\\\"$L2e\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"nav\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-14 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-sandstone-deep/60 pt-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L5\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/en/tirtha/tirtha-088\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"group flex items-center gap-1.5 font-ui text-sm text-ink-soft hover:text-maroon transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L1a\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"iconNode\\\":[[\\\"path\\\",{\\\"d\\\":\\\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\\\",\\\"key\\\":\\\"1wnfg3\\\"}]],\\\"className\\\":\\\"lucide-chevron-left h-4 w-4\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":true}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",n